msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"I would like to use MailCraft with my work account. MailCraft is an open-source mail and calendar program that runs on my own computer. Our organisation lets only an administrator approve a new program, so it needs your approval once, for the whole organisation. Microsoft's page for that is here:\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"After you approve, your browser may show a page that can't be reached. That is expected: it is an address on your own computer, where nothing is listening, and the approval has been given by then.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you"
msgstr ""
"您好，\n"
"\n"
"我希望使用工作账户登录 MailCraft。MailCraft 是运行在我自己电脑上的开源邮件和日历程序。我们组织只允许管理员批准新程序，因此需要您为整个组织批准一次。Microsoft 授权页面如下：\n"
"\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"批准后，浏览器可能显示无法访问的页面。这是预期现象：该地址位于您自己的电脑上，没有程序监听；此时授权已经完成。\n"
"\n"
"谢谢"

